      <h1>How Software Actually Works</h1>
      <p class="article-deck">From a click on your screen to code, servers, databases, bugs, debugging, testing, deployment, and reliability — explained for someone who has never written a line of code.</p>
      <p class="article-meta">SODIQ BABATUNDE OLOGUN · TUNDECODES · LONG READ</p>
      <p class="reading-note">You do not need programming experience for this article. Every code example is explained in plain English.</p>
